@startuml
title State Machine Diagram - Mission

[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> ASSIGNED : submitMission() succeeds
CREATED --> FAILED : submitMission() rejected
ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : start()
ASSIGNED --> FAILED : problem found
IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : advance() [time left]
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : advance() [timepassed >= duration]
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : problem found
COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
@enduml
